                                "text": "1878, Henrietta Keddie (Sarah Tytler), Summer Snow\nShe was comely in her tall fairness; but Hal's manly brown had entirely obviated the charge of a certain wheyness of tint, which might attach itself to Debby's flaxen hair, light eyebrows, and blonde, rather colourless skin."
